    {
      "section": "social-proof.testimonial-stack",
      "variant": "default",
      "retrievalEligible": true,
      "content": {
        "eyebrow": "TESTIMONIALS",
        "heading": "APPARENTLY, THEY LIKE US",
        "testimonials": [
          {
            "headline": "Working with Bogdan and Diana has been one of the smoothest collaborations I've had",
            "quote": "They're sharp, always responsive, and have a real talent for turning briefs into compelling visuals. No matter the challenge: tight deadlines, shifting requirements, tricky creative constraints, they always show up with solutions. Highly recommend working with them!",
            "name": "Ruxandra Florescu",
            "role": "COO, Dare Digital"
          },
          {
            "headline": "Bogdan and Diana truly brought HeyGluco to life",
            "quote": "Both of them are truly amazing humans, with an incredible amount of creativity and talent. They took our vision, understood it completely, and brought it to life in ways that went beyond anything we could have imagined. We absolutely loved working with them and feel incredibly lucky that, along the way, we got to call them friends. We cannot brag about them or recommend them highly enough. They are the kind of people you feel lucky to have found, and luckier to have worked with! ❤️",
            "name": "Luiza Zamfirescu",
            "role": "Co-Founder, HeyGluco"
          },
          {
            "headline": "Working with Two26 is a bit like brainstorming ideas with your best friends",
            "quote": "Always fun, always insightful, always constructive. It hardly feels like working, cause the whole process is always so smooth. That's what you get for getting the job done with cool creatives, I guess.",
            "name": "Vlad Belcin",
            "role": "Sr. Copywriter, Dare Digital"
          },
          {
            "headline": "Four projects and counting",
            "quote": "We’ve worked together on two websites and two visual identities so far, and it’s been a pleasure every time. Great ideas, really well executed, and just lovely people to work with. Pretty sure we’re not done yet.",
            "name": "Ionut Belet",
            "role": "Founder, MVP Agency"
          },
          {
            "headline": "Better than we imagined",
            "quote": "Working with Two26 on our brand identity was a great experience from start to finish. They’re incredibly creative and thoughtful, but also easy to work with and genuinely invested in getting things right. They brought ideas we wouldn’t have thought of ourselves and gave the brand a personality that really feels like us. You can tell they care about the work, but also about the people behind it.",
            "name": "Monica Tantu",
            "role": "Co-Founder, Merci"
          }
        ]
      },
